    "chunk_text": "\u00fees bote, & gemeta & gewihta rihte man georne, & \u00e6lces unrihtes heonan for\u00f0 geswice. & burhbota & bricbota aginne man georne on \u00e6ghwilcon ende, & fyrdunga eac & scipfyrdunga & w\u00e6rlic bi\u00f0, \u00fe\u00e6t man \u00e6ghwilce geare sona \u00e6fter eastron fyrdscipa gearwige. & gyf hwa folces fyrdscip awyrde, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t georne, & cyninge \u00fea munde; & gif hit man amyrre, \u00fe\u00e6t & gif hwa of fyrde butan leafe gewende, \u00fee cyning sylf on sy, plihte his are. & gif mor\u00f0wyrhtan o\u00f0\u00f0e mansworan o\u00f0\u00f0e \u00e6b\u00e6re manslagan to \u00feam ge\u00feristian, \u00fe\u00e6t hy on \u00fe\u00e6s cyninges & gyf hwa ymbe cyninges feorh syrwe, sy he his feores scyldig & ealles \u00fe\u00e6s \u00fee he age, gif hit him & gif hwa forsteal ongean lahriht Cristes o\u00fe\u00fee cyninges ahwar gewyrce, gylde wer o\u00fe\u00fee wite be \u00feam \u00fee & gif hwa nunnan gewemme o\u00fe\u00fee wydewan nydn\u00e6me, gebete \u00fe\u00e6t deope for Gode & for worolde. & smeage man symle on \u00e6ghwilce wisan, hu man fyrmest m\u00e6ge r\u00e6d aredian, \u00feeode to \u00feearfe, & rihtne For\u00feam \u00feurh \u00fe\u00e6t hit sceal on earde godian to ahte, \u00fee man unriht alecge & rihtwisnesse lufige for Nu wille we eac l\u00e6ran Godes \u00feeowas georne, \u00fe\u00e6t hy huru hy sylfe w\u00e6rlice be\u00feencan & \u00feurh Godes Eac we",
